OL,3,CLuke Littler to star in live darts
OL,4,Cevent on Netflix
OL,6,FLuke Littler has announced plans to
OL,7,Fstar in a new Netflix show which will
OL,8,Fsee amateur darts players compete
OL,9,Fagainst him for a chance to win
OL,10,F#501,000.
OL,12,F'Beat Luke Littler' will be a live
OL,13,Fdarts event in which 20 chosen people
OL,14,Fwill try to defeat the 19-year-old
OL,15,Ffrom Warrington, Cheshire.
OL,17,FHopeful contenders can enter open
OL,18,Fregional heats in London and
OL,19,FManchester in September 2026.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
