OL,3,CLuke Littler to star in live darts
OL,4,Cevent on Netflix
OL,6,FLittler himself led the call-out in a
OL,7,Fvideo where he can be seen reading
OL,8,Fsocial media messages from people
OL,9,Fclaiming they could beat him.
OL,11,FIn the video, he said: "Reckon you
OL,12,Fcould beat me in a game of darts?
OL,13,FLet's go."
OL,15,FAnyone aged 12 and over can apply, and
OL,16,Fthe show will air on Friday, 30
OL,17,FOctober, live on Netflix.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
