OL,3,CLuke Littler to star in live darts
OL,4,Cevent on Netflix
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after Littler
OL,7,Fbeat Gerwyn Price 18-9 to retain his
OL,8,FBetfred World Matchplay title in
OL,9,FBlackpool on Sunday, 26 July.
OL,11,FThe champion hit 12 in the final to
OL,12,Freach 66 for the week, breaking his
OL,13,Fown competition record for 180s.
OL,15,FThe win keeps Littler on course for a
OL,16,Fclean sweep of trophies this year,
OL,17,Fhaving already won the World
OL,18,FChampionship, UK Open, Premier League
OL,19,Fand the Masters.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
