OL,3,CLuke Littler to star in live darts
OL,4,Cevent on Netflix
OL,6,FHis breakout year came in 2024 when he
OL,7,Fwon the Premier League and Grand Slam
OL,8,Fof Darts.
OL,10,FHe became the youngest world number
OL,11,Fone at the 2025 PDC World Darts
OL,12,FChampionship in January 2025 at just
OL,13,F17 years old.
OL,15,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,16,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,17,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,18,Four region.
